  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Norec, FK Norway, personnell exchange</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">India, Nepal. The overall objective of the project is to strengthen the capacity of organisations to fight against the social malpractices of trafficking and gender based discrimination and violence in Nepal and India. The project will use group exchange as a method, where four participants from each country will work together four months in Nepal and four months in India.</narrative>
  </description>
